before:
Complete local Kotlin/JVM example; the app itself does not execute it:
```kotlin
fun minutes(n: Int): Int {
    require(n > 0)
    return n
}
fun main() {
    val result = try { minutes(5).toString() }
        catch (e: IllegalArgumentException) { "rejected" }
    println(result)
}
```

